1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,742
An offline-first teacher workspace for a Nigerian primary school. Parents use ordinary SMS. Pupils have no account or app. Synthetic data only.

2
00:00:15,742 --> 00:00:26,965
Classes, pending work, family messages and an evidence summary: three pupils need attention.

3
00:00:26,965 --> 00:00:39,493
Attendance, assessment scores, teacher observations, follow-ups and evidence confidence in one pupil view.

4
00:00:39,493 --> 00:00:49,125
Kofar Primary: two classes, eight pupils, the same guardians, attendance dates, assessments and observations.

5
00:00:49,125 --> 00:01:03,908
100% attendance, an 87% assessment average, three assessments and two approved observations. Status and confidence come from the deterministic engine.

6
00:01:03,908 --> 00:01:13,426
Plant parts and functions is the common gap. Musa and Tunde need attention. Ngozi improved by twelve points. Every number links back to records.

7
00:01:13,426 --> 00:01:22,525
Suggested from attendance, assessment or observation. The teacher decides what to add, when it is due and when it is done.

8
00:01:22,525 --> 00:01:42,626
The SDK reports the actual source, duration, evidence fingerprint and fallback. Verified here: Cloud Gemini. Gemini Nano is not claimed.

9
00:01:42,626 --> 00:01:52,924
Deterministic class gaps, attention pupils and evidence-informed lesson planning. AI never blocks the core workflow.

10
00:01:52,924 --> 00:02:13,590
Remaining gates: a supported on-device Nano device, deployed callables under a paid plan, live SMS, physical-device review and native translation review.
